## High-Performance RPC

### Service Definition (.proto)

```protobuf
syntax = "proto3";

service UserService {
  rpc GetUser (GetUserRequest) returns (User);
  rpc ListUsers (ListUsersRequest) returns (stream User);
  rpc CreateUser (stream CreateUserRequest) returns (CreateUserResponse);
  rpc Chat (stream ChatMessage) returns (stream ChatMessage);
}

message User {
  int32 id = 1;
  string name = 2;
  string email = 3;
}

message GetUserRequest {
  int32 user_id = 1;
}
```

### Generated XIOM Code

Running `xiom-grpc-codegen` produces:

```xiom
// Generated: user_service.xi
pub interface UserService {
  fn get_user(self: &Self, req: GetUserRequest) -> Result[User, Status];
  fn list_users(self: &Self, req: ListUsersRequest) -> Stream[User];
}
```

### Server Implementation

```xiom
use generated::user_service;

pub type UserServiceImpl = { db: Database; }

impl UserService for UserServiceImpl {
  fn get_user(self: &UserServiceImpl, req: GetUserRequest) -> Result[User, Status] {
    let user = self.db.find_user(req.user_id)?;
    return Ok(user);
  }

  fn list_users(self: &UserServiceImpl, req: ListUsersRequest) -> Stream[User] {
    return self.db.all_users()
      .filter(|u| u.active)
      .take(req.limit);
  }
}

fn main() -> Int {
  let service = UserServiceImpl{ db: Database::open("app.db")? };
  let server = grpc::Server::new()
    .add_service(UserService::new(service))
    .listen(50051)?;
  io.println("gRPC server listening on :50051");
  server.serve();
  return 0;
}
```

### Client Usage

```xiom
fn main() -> Int {
  let client = UserServiceClient::connect("http://localhost:50051")?;

  // Unary call
  let user = client.get_user(GetUserRequest{ user_id: 1 })?;
  io.println("User: " + user.name);

  // Server streaming
  let stream = client.list_users(ListUsersRequest{ limit: 10 })?;
  for user in stream {
    io.println(user.name);
  }
  return 0;
}
```

### Streaming Patterns

| Pattern | Client | Server |
|---------|--------|--------|
| Unary | 1 request | 1 response |
| Server streaming | 1 request | N responses |
| Client streaming | N requests | 1 response |
| Bidirectional | N requests | N responses |

### Error Handling

```xiom
// Server errors become gRPC status codes:
return Err(Status::not_found("User not found"));
return Err(Status::invalid_argument("Email is required"));
return Err(Status::internal("Database error"));
```

